摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"把 WorkBuddy 国内版和国际版的免费/付费模型接进 DeepSeek Harness —— 无需下载 WorkBuddy 桌面端。","id":"gh:1410811549","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-workbuddy","slug":"Faide-cyber/dsh-workbuddy","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","model-provider","workbuddy"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"把 WorkBuddy 国内版和国际版的免费/付费模型接进 DeepSeek Harness —— 无需下载 WorkBuddy 桌面端。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DSH WorkBuddy"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Bring WorkBuddy's free and paid models (domestic and international) into DeepSeek Harness — no WorkB"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"uddy desktop app required."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Sign-in**: per-region browser OAuth, no desktop sign-in at all; a credential from an installed d"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"esktop app can still be imported read-only\n- **Accounts**: region-isolated multi-account list, expli"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"cit switching, credit display and warnings; accounts can be given their own names; education account"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"s are now supported; the plugin's copies are kept apart from the desktop auth files\n- **One-click ch"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"eck-in**: daily check-in, the cat's growth trip and every growth-center task (签到 / 猫猫旅行) collected i"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"n a single action for supported personal accounts; auto check-in is available and off by default\n- *"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"*Device isolation**: each account's credential, its model catalog and its credit balance stand apart"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"; switching accounts never touches in-flight requests\n- **Works out of the box**: install it, enable"},{"id":"p5s9","text":" it, and use it from DSH — no extra configuration; DSH 0.2.x desktop is supported today"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"1. Node 22+, with DSH installed.\n2. Install the plugin and start:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"3. Open **Settings → Plugins → DSH WorkBuddy**, click **Connect**, and sign in on the WorkBuddy page"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" that opens.\n4. Pick a **WorkBuddy** model in the model selector — with the default **free models on"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ly** scope, the list is exactly what that region's catalog prices `x0.00` right now."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"You can also sign in from a terminal:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Restart `dsh web`** after installing, updating, or signing in. Refreshing the browser is not enoug"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"h — Node modules stay in memory."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The default model can be set in `~/.dsh/settings.yaml`:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Use an id the region actually lists: the model list is whatever that region's live catalog returns, "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"so a pinned default can become stale. `hy3` is free in both regions at the time of writing."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How sign-in works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Each region uses the official CLI auth endpoints independently:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. `POST /v2/plugin/auth/state?platform=CLI&nonce=` (international `www.workbuddy.ai`, domestic `cop"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ilot.tencent.com`)\n2. Open the returned `authUrl`\n3. Poll `GET /v2/plugin/auth/token?state=` (upstre"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"am returns `11217` while still pending)\n4. The token is written to the region's plugin copy: interna"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"tional `$DSH_HOME/.workbuddy-ai-auth.json`, domestic `$DSH_HOME/.workbuddy-cn-auth.json`"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The desktop app's `workbuddy-desktop-ai.info` (international) and `workbuddy-desktop.info` (domestic"},{"id":"p19s2","text":") are read-only — the plugin never writes them. It only stores its own per-region credential copies "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"obtained through OAuth."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The settings card lists every imported account. Switching only affects subsequent requests; in-fligh"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"t requests keep using the original account, and bulk credit/check-in operations do not change the cu"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"using the original account, and bulk credit/check-in operations do not change the current selection."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"**Disconnect** / `logout` only deletes that region's own plugin credentials; the desktop app is unto"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"onnect** / `logout` only deletes that region's own plugin credentials; the desktop app is untouched."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Settings → Plugins → **DSH WorkBuddy**:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Connect / Disconnect**: per-region browser sign-in, or delete that region's plugin credentials\n-"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" Domestic/international account lists, official edition badges, explicit switching, remaining credit"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"s, and a connectivity test\n- Tick domestic personal accounts for auto check-in (off by default); edu"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"cation accounts do not expose check-in controls\n- The active account refreshes read-only every 15 mi"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"nutes and others every 60 minutes by default — configurable\n- **Free models only** (default) / **All"},{"id":"p24s6","text":" others every 60 minutes by default — configurable\n- **Free models only** (default) / **All models**"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Or configure it in the profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Environment variables:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Variable | Effect |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| `DSH_WORKBUDDY_AUTH_FILE` | Override the international desktop credential path (OAuth credentials "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"still go to the plugin's own file) |\n| `DSH_WORKBUDDY_CN_AUTH_FILE` | Override the domestic desktop "},{"id":"p29s3","text":"lugin's own file) |\n| `DSH_WORKBUDDY_CN_AUTH_FILE` | Override the domestic desktop credential path |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## CLI"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"`status` / `doctor` accept `--json`. `logout` only deletes `$DSH_HOME/.workbuddy-ai-auth.json`."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Symptom | Fix |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| No card in settings / no WorkBuddy in the model list | Restart `dsh web`; refreshing the browser i"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"s not enough |\n| `dsh web` exits after clicking Connect | On headless Linux without `xdg-open`, upda"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"te to a build with spawn `error` handling; use the sign-in link on the card |\n| 403 `request-not-tru"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"sted` when opening the card over a LAN IP | Add that IP/hostname to `allowedHosts`; do not put it in"},{"id":"p35s5","text":" the loopback list |\n| Signed in but no models | The region's catalog request failed or returned not"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"hing — check connectivity and whether the token is still valid; the list stays empty rather than bor"},{"id":"p35s7","text":"rowing the other region's models |\n| `doctor` says signed-out | Run `login` first, or confirm the in"},{"id":"p35s8","text":"ternational desktop app is signed in |\n| Want paid models | Switch the scope to \"All models\" on the "},{"id":"p35s9","text":"settings card — credits will be burned |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Disclaimer"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"For personal learning and research only, driving your own WorkBuddy account on your own machine. Fol"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"low the WorkBuddy terms of service. This project is not affiliated with Tencent, WorkBuddy, or DeepS"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"the WorkBuddy terms of service. This project is not affiliated with Tencent, WorkBuddy, or DeepSeek."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
